    "content": {
      "1": "<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>学校深入落实就业工作</span><span xss=removed>“一把手工程”，确保就业工作组织机构、人员配备、场地保障、经费支持、制度保障“五个到位”。本年度学校共出台了《湖南医药学院</span><span xss=removed>2024</span><span xss=removed>届毕业生就业工作实施方案》《湖南医药学院</span><span xss=removed>2024</span><span xss=removed>届毕业生就业“百日冲刺”行动实施方案》等多个政策性文件确保就业工作的顺利开展。</span></span></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>学校通过开展书记校长</span><span xss=removed>“访企拓岗促就业”“就业攻坚行动”、校园招聘等活动，积极拓展就业岗位，大力促进毕业生就业。党委书记、校长带头开展访企拓岗专项活动，共走访</span><span xss=removed>169</span><span xss=removed>家单位；开展线上招聘会、宣讲会、线下专场招聘活动</span><span xss=removed>20</span><span xss=removed>余场，为毕业生提供就业岗位达近</span><span xss=removed>1.2</span><span xss=removed>万个。对</span><span xss=removed>255</span><span xss=removed>名困难毕业生进行了“一对一”精准帮扶，建立了帮扶数据库和台账，确定帮扶责任人，确保了有就业意愿的原建档立卡家庭毕业生</span><span xss=removed>100%</span><span xss=removed>就业，并为</span><span xss=removed>305</span><span xss=removed>名求职困难的</span><span xss=removed>2024</span><span xss=removed>届毕业生申领发放一次性求职创业补贴</span><span xss=removed>462000</span><span xss=removed>元。截至</span><span xss=removed>2024</span><span xss=removed>年</span><span xss=removed>8</span><span xss=removed>月</span><span xss=removed>31</span><span xss=removed>日，学校应届本科毕业生总体毕业去向落实率达</span><span xss=removed>85.53%</span><span xss=removed>。分专业毕业生去向落实率见附表</span><span xss=removed>9</span><span xss=removed>。</span></span></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>附表9 分专业毕业生去向落实率</span></span></p><p xss=removed></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed></span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://static-data.gaokao.cn//upload/image/202606/core_1780915569_3352_thumb.png\" xss=removed title=\"core_1780915569_3352_thumb.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://static-data.gaokao.cn//upload/image/202606/core_1780915569_4958_thumb.png\" xss=removed title=\"core_1780915569_4958_thumb.png\"></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed></span></span><br></p><p><br></p>"
